+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: dt.d_year ASC NULLS LAST, sum_agg DESC NULLS FIRST, brand_id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   Projection: dt.d_year, item.i_brand_id AS brand_id, item.i_brand AS brand, sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit) AS sum_agg                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[dt.d_year, item.i_brand, item.i_brand_id]], aggr=[[sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |       Projection: dt.d_year, store_sales.ss_net_profit, item.i_brand_id, item.i_brand                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |         Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |  Projection: dt.d_date_sk, dt.d_year, dt.d_moy, store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk, store_sales.ss_item_sk, store_sales.ss_net_profit, item.i_item_sk, item.i_brand_id, item.i_brand                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   Inner Join:  Filter: store_sales.ss_item_sk = item.i_item_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: dt.d_date_sk = store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       Filter: dt.d_moy = Int64(12)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |         SubqueryAlias: dt                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |           TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk, d_year, d_moy]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       TableScan: store_sales projection=[ss_sold_date_sk, ss_item_sk, ss_net_profit]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_brand_id, i_brand], full_filters=[item.i_manufact_id = Int64(445)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [d_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST, sum_agg@3 DESC, brand_id@1 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[d_year@0 as d_year, i_brand_id@2 as brand_id, i_brand@1 as brand, sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit)@3 as sum_agg]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=100), expr=[d_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST, sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit)@3 DESC, i_brand_id@2 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[d_year@0 as d_year, i_brand@1 as i_brand, i_brand_id@2 as i_brand_id], aggr=[sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([d_year@0, i_brand@1, i_brand_id@2], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[d_year@0 as d_year, i_brand@3 as i_brand, i_brand_id@2 as i_brand_id], aggr=[sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |             RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[d_year@1 as d_year, ss_net_profit@5 as ss_net_profit, i_brand_id@7 as i_brand_id, i_brand@8 as i_brand]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                 SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                   BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                     VirtualExecutionPlan name=sqlite compute_context=memory base_sql=SELECT `dt`.`d_date_sk`, `dt`.`d_year`, `dt`.`d_moy`, `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_item_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_net_profit`, `item`.`i_item_sk`, `item`.`i_brand_id`, `item`.`i_brand` FROM `date_dim` AS `dt` INNER JOIN `store_sales` ON (`dt`.`d_date_sk` = `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`) INNER JOIN `item` ON (`store_sales`.`ss_item_sk` = `item`.`i_item_sk`) WHERE (`dt`.`d_moy` = 12) AND (`item`.`i_manufact_id` = 445) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
